WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:06.270 --> 00:00:07.970
- Hi, I'm Simone De La Rue.

00:00:07.970 --> 00:00:10.210
Creator of Body By Simone.

00:00:10.210 --> 00:00:12.197
Here are five simple exercises

00:00:12.197 --> 00:00:15.160
that are gonna give you
a full body workout.

00:00:15.160 --> 00:00:17.890
Let's start off first with cardio.

00:00:17.890 --> 00:00:19.210
We're gonna do a jump squat.

00:00:19.210 --> 00:00:22.050
This is working our largest
muscle groups in our body.

00:00:22.050 --> 00:00:24.890
So that's working our quads,
our hamstrings, and our glutes.

00:00:24.890 --> 00:00:27.960
And it's gonna fire up our
heart rate so that we're really

00:00:27.960 --> 00:00:30.070
gonna get in our cardio fix

00:00:30.070 --> 00:00:32.275
for a nice jump squat, so you start down,

00:00:32.275 --> 00:00:34.667
you jump up in the air, and lower down.

00:00:34.667 --> 00:00:36.895
Again, jump up and lower down.

00:00:36.895 --> 00:00:39.302
Jump up and lower down.

00:00:39.302 --> 00:00:41.930
Jump up and lower down.

00:00:41.930 --> 00:00:43.608
And squeeze.

00:00:43.608 --> 00:00:47.133
Yes, you're gonna do
three sets of 10 of those.

00:00:47.133 --> 00:00:49.750
Heart rate will be up.

00:00:49.750 --> 00:00:51.034
That is your cardio.

00:00:51.034 --> 00:00:54.390
The next exercise, shoulder press.

00:00:54.390 --> 00:00:56.948
We're working our deltoid and our pecs.

00:00:56.948 --> 00:01:00.820
I'm using a resistance band, the CLX band.

00:01:00.820 --> 00:01:02.580
You can use hand weights,

00:01:02.580 --> 00:01:05.507
or you can use cans or bottles of water.

00:01:05.507 --> 00:01:09.350
Come back down again into
your squat, up to goal post.

00:01:09.350 --> 00:01:11.402
Reaching up and down.

00:01:11.402 --> 00:01:14.010
And up and down.

00:01:14.010 --> 00:01:15.880
Upper body workout.

00:01:15.880 --> 00:01:17.480
Deltoid, chest.

00:01:17.480 --> 00:01:19.964
Pull in those abs, keep
those shoulders down.

00:01:19.964 --> 00:01:23.296
If you have hand weights, pushing them up.

00:01:23.296 --> 00:01:24.743
And up.

00:01:25.770 --> 00:01:26.763
And up.

00:01:27.640 --> 00:01:28.730
Excellent.

00:01:28.730 --> 00:01:32.538
We're also gonna do three
sets between 10 and 12 reps.

00:01:32.538 --> 00:01:35.382
Third exercise is the plank.

00:01:35.382 --> 00:01:37.710
So we're gonna come back
to our static plank.

00:01:37.710 --> 00:01:39.630
Elbows over top of wrists, I should say.

00:01:39.630 --> 00:01:42.006
Kick back, tuck that little booty under.

00:01:42.006 --> 00:01:45.053
Everything's engaged, and hold.

00:01:46.260 --> 00:01:49.520
I'm gonna lower my back
knee down and lift it up.

00:01:49.520 --> 00:01:52.110
My front knee down, and lift it up.

00:01:52.110 --> 00:01:54.735
And both knees down, and up.

00:01:54.735 --> 00:01:56.953
And down again.

00:01:56.953 --> 00:01:58.700
Back knee.

00:01:58.700 --> 00:02:00.510
Nothing's moving off my back.

00:02:00.510 --> 00:02:03.500
You can have a tray of
cookies or a tray of champagne

00:02:03.500 --> 00:02:06.107
resting on there and they will not spill.

00:02:06.107 --> 00:02:10.050
And what's really working
into your lower abs.

00:02:10.050 --> 00:02:11.300
And down.

00:02:11.300 --> 00:02:13.350
Let's do one more time, perfectly still.

00:02:13.350 --> 00:02:16.186
Lower abs, lower abs.

00:02:16.186 --> 00:02:19.020
Both and both.

00:02:19.020 --> 00:02:20.550
And up.

00:02:20.550 --> 00:02:21.383
And rest.

00:02:21.383 --> 00:02:22.216
Good.

00:02:22.216 --> 00:02:24.730
Three sets of 10 to 12 reps of those.

00:02:24.730 --> 00:02:27.500
You're especially gonna
feel that in your lower abs.

00:02:27.500 --> 00:02:30.510
Next exercise, booty, yes.

00:02:30.510 --> 00:02:32.340
We want a nice shapely booty.

00:02:32.340 --> 00:02:34.800
I'm gonna use the resistance band again.

00:02:34.800 --> 00:02:36.660
If you don't have this you can use

00:02:36.660 --> 00:02:38.750
and do these exercises without.

00:02:38.750 --> 00:02:41.149
You can try putting an ankle weight on.

00:02:41.149 --> 00:02:43.860
Or you can use this.

00:02:43.860 --> 00:02:45.373
Foot in a loop.

00:02:47.390 --> 00:02:48.810
So I'm gonna do a kickback

00:02:48.810 --> 00:02:51.777
that's gonna work into
my hamstring and glute.

00:02:51.777 --> 00:02:53.921
So I'm coming into tabletop position.

00:02:53.921 --> 00:02:55.520
Kick my leg up.

00:02:55.520 --> 00:02:57.985
It's gonna go parallel
against the resistance.

00:02:57.985 --> 00:03:01.189
My foot is flexed, my leg is parallel.

00:03:01.189 --> 00:03:06.189
Bring that knee into my navel
and I kick straight back.

00:03:07.230 --> 00:03:10.173
Into navel, straight back.

00:03:12.410 --> 00:03:13.243
Good.

00:03:13.243 --> 00:03:16.119
Without the resistance
band, same exercise.

00:03:16.119 --> 00:03:17.973
Try an ankle weight.

00:03:22.540 --> 00:03:23.373
Straight back.

00:03:24.697 --> 00:03:27.954
And straight back, good.

00:03:28.537 --> 00:03:31.086
For that one, we're gonna do two sets 

00:03:31.111 --> 00:03:33.869
of 20 reps on each leg.

00:03:33.869 --> 00:03:36.290
And now for our outer and inner thighs.

00:03:36.290 --> 00:03:39.120
So our adductors and abductors.

00:03:39.120 --> 00:03:43.393
Line up, elbow underneath
shoulder, extend both legs.

00:03:43.393 --> 00:03:46.520
Pull up that waist if you
have any shoulder issues,

00:03:46.520 --> 00:03:48.440
you can do this laying down.

00:03:48.440 --> 00:03:49.610
If not, stay up.

00:03:49.610 --> 00:03:52.840
We're gonna work, lift the top leg up.

00:03:52.840 --> 00:03:53.980
Outer thigh.

00:03:53.980 --> 00:03:56.150
This underneath leg is the working one.

00:03:56.150 --> 00:03:57.210
This is the tricky one.

00:03:57.210 --> 00:04:00.130
You come underneath it, click that heel,

00:04:00.130 --> 00:04:02.690
place it down and lower down.

00:04:02.690 --> 00:04:06.658
We do lift and squeeze and down and down.

00:04:06.658 --> 00:04:08.574
Lift and squeeze.

00:04:08.574 --> 00:04:10.913
You wanna keep those legs parallel.

00:04:10.913 --> 00:04:13.230
You're gonna make sure
that your hips are stacked

00:04:13.230 --> 00:04:15.460
on top of each other and that your navel's

00:04:15.460 --> 00:04:17.220
drawing towards your spine.

00:04:17.220 --> 00:04:19.610
And you're just lifting
the leg to hip height.

00:04:19.610 --> 00:04:21.790
Parallel and pointed.

00:04:21.790 --> 00:04:23.834
Close heels, down and up.

00:04:23.834 --> 00:04:26.040
Abduction, adduction.

00:04:28.315 --> 00:04:29.500
Whoo hoo hoo.

00:04:29.500 --> 00:04:30.333
Good.

00:04:30.333 --> 00:04:34.520
And those will also be two
sets of 20 reps on each side.

00:04:34.520 --> 00:04:36.990
So those five exercises should take you

00:04:36.990 --> 00:04:40.690
about 15 to 20 minutes
in length to do them.

00:04:40.690 --> 00:04:43.100
And remember, we don't
wanna speed through it.

00:04:43.100 --> 00:04:46.240
We wanna use correct
technique and correct form

00:04:46.240 --> 00:04:48.460
because that's the way you see results.

00:04:48.460 --> 00:04:49.293
Good luck.

